; Base CPF merge, applied to every instance in every stack via ISC_CPF_MERGE_FILE.
; Re-applied on every container start, and idempotent.
;
; Stacks that need their own databases or namespaces do not include this file
; directly: they have their own merge file which repeats the [Actions] line below
; and adds CreateDatabase / CreateNamespace actions. IRIS accepts only one merge
; file, so there is nothing to include from.

[Actions]
; A fresh instance has SuperUser flagged "password change required", which makes
; the first login - portal, JDBC or iris session - fail with a forced interactive
; change. Verified on 2026.1: SuperUser has ChangePassword=1 out of the box.
;
; CSPSystem, the account the Web Gateway logs in with, is already ChangePassword=0
; on 2026.1 and therefore needs no line here. Older projects still set it.
ModifyUser:Name=SuperUser,ChangePassword=0
